        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-07T11:54:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The chicken and dumplings qualifier is important. The word 'dumpling' in English comes from that style: you just sort of dump floury dough into water, and then you have a dumpling, no fillings required.</p>",
