      {
        "id": 217905,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-07T14:38:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think this qualifies as a sub-debate of gnocchi…Though the classification thereof could be a debate in and of itself!&nbsp;<em>The spiral never ends and by spiral I of course mean spiral pasta</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><br>How so?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Gnocchi literaly translates as \"dumplings.\"</p>",
